+// b2422 STL (brain_flags.h; the caller read the flag): the visible foes' two-turn damage on a body at tile p (within 9 of p; each foe's
+// lethal_burst_two_turn_hit, a stun that takes its next turn adds 0), summed, stopping once it reaches cap.
+float stl_two_turn_damage_at(vec2 p, float cap)
